  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> be the vector along the line of intersection of given planes.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>8</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Now, angle between the plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;and the line of intersection of the planes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>17</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>17</mn></mfrac></msqrt></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>17</mn></mfrac></msqrt></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
